  "label": "Context of rectal exams in medical practice",
  "description": "A rectal exam is a common medical procedure performed by doctors to assess the health of the rectum and surrounding organs. While it is routine and necessary in certain diagnostic contexts (e.g., prostate exams in men), it is often associated with embarrassment or discomfort, which is why the meme uses it for comedic effect. The meme implies this procedure is common and not exclusive to any particular group.",
